; Gap tables (count,value pairs), SD at 0751h, DD at 075Fh:
; SD: 16 FF, 3 00, 3 00, 11 FF, 3 00, 3 00, 10 FF
; DD: 32 4E, 12 00, 3 F5, 22 4E, 12 00, 3 F5, 24 4E
; Mutable data: 150Dh cylinder count, 150Eh error count, 150Fh cylinder,
; 1510h first sector ID, 1511h side, 151Ah temporary destination DPB.
; IX -> BIOS physical-drive record; IY -> selected/temporary MM DPB.
; 5900h is the shared transient track/physical-sector buffer.
